                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970, AMD Radeon R9 290 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 200 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> N/A<br></li><li><strong>Compatibilidade com R.V.:</strong> SteamVR. Room Scale 2m by 1.5m area required<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> VR Only! Built for HTC Vive.</li></ul>",
